OL,3,GNEWSA'Amazing' girl back to school
OL,4,Aafter cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-year-old girl has started a new
OL,7,Fschool year two years after she was
OL,8,Fdiagnosed with cancer.
OL,10,FNeil, from Woking, Surrey, said that
OL,11,Fhis daughter Sienna was "excited to see
OL,12,Fher friends again", but was "nervous,
OL,13,Flike most children are" about beginning
OL,14,FYear 1.
OL,16,F"Thankfully it is quite a nice worry if
OL,17,FI am being honest," he told the BBC.
OL,19,FSienna had to isolate for several
OL,20,Fmonths after being diagnosed with acute
OL,21,Flymphoblastic leukaemia in 2024.
